OL,3,AThe Pitt and ER are similar enough for
OL,4,Alawsuit to proceed, judge rules
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS drama The Pitt is similar enough to
OL,7,Fmedical series ER for a lawsuit against
OL,8,Fits producers to progress, a court in
OL,9,Fthe US has ruled.
OL,11,FThe widow of Michael Crichton, who
OL,12,Fcreated ER, argues The Pitt is
OL,13,Feffectively a reboot of the series,
OL,14,Fwhich has been made without proper
OL,15,Fpermission or credit.
OL,17,FSherri Crichton says her husband's
OL,18,Fcontract included a "frozen rights"
OL,19,Fprovision that prohibited any
OL,20,Fspin-offs, sequels or reboots of ER
OL,21,Fbeing made without his express consent.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,163,160,200,105,0,100
PN,11913
SC,0013
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1793882893
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+j 55"k#j 5w;js1
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AThe Pitt and ER are similar enough for
OL,4,Alawsuit to proceed, judge rules
OL,5,
OL,6,FA three-judge panel said there are
OL,7,F"clear and numerous similarities
OL,8,Fbetween The Pitt and ER," which means
OL,9,Fthe case can go ahead. Warner Bros
OL,10,Fpreviously described the lawsuit as
OL,11,F"baseless" and sought to have it
OL,12,Fdismissed.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/19
